This repository contains the Tomato homebrew 32-bit CPU architecture, including
the dual-LUT bit-slice datapath (independent 3-input LUT planes f(A,B,C) and
g(A,B,C) summed through a carry network), modular microcode control, KiCad PCB
designs, Digital simulation sources, RTL netlists, verification harnesses, and
documentation.

